1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:02,500
(Sheldon-bot :)I must speak to him.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,910
(Leonard:)Of course you must.

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,620
(Penny:)You know, there's an
Olive Garden down the street.

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:11,170
(Penny:)You guys should try it sometime.

5
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:14,160
(Sheldon-bot :)Excuse me,
Mr. Wozniak?

6
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,330
(Steve Wozniak:)Oh, hey.

7
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:17,230
(Steve Wozniak:)Nice virtual presence device.

8
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:18,210
(Leonard:)Thank you.

9
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:20,760
(Sheldon-bot :)I just want to say
I'm a big fan.

10
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:24,700
You're my 15th favorite
technological visionary.

11
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,350
Only 15th?

12
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:29,960
(Sheldon-bot :)It's still six spots
above Steve Jobs.

13
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:32,310
(Sheldon-bot :)I care neither for turtlenecks

14
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,180
(Sheldon-bot :)nor showmanship.

15
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:37,550
(Steve Wozniak:)Yeah, I never got
that turtleneck thing.

16
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:41,480
(Sheldon-bot :)One of my proudest possessions
is a vintage 1977 Apple Two.

17
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:46,010
(Sheldon-bot :)Despite the file system
limitations of Apple DOS 3.3,

18
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:48,310
(Sheldon-bot :)it was a pretty nifty
little achievement.

19
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:50,590
(Steve Wozniak:)Thanks, we were shooting
for "nifty."

20
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,450
(Steve Wozniak:)You know, if you had it here,

21
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:54,050
(Steve Wozniak:)I'd autograph it for you.

22
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,280
(Sheldon-bot:)Don't move
for 15 to 30 minutes,

23
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon-bot:)depending on how
the buses are running.

